    "turn_text": "You've got in the book, you've got some bouquets for both Mayor Mike Bloomberg and Mayor Pete Buttigieg. Are you seeing examples in their presidential campaign of how they're taking these ideas and nationalizing them? I have to say, honestly listening to them, I don't actually hear as much about the experience of their cities as I might",
